# oracle: Ewald with the automatic kmax under fix deform: native chooses kmax again at each box change (the box grows 40% in x, so kmax_x rises during the run), with the accuracy and charges of init
units           real
atom_style      charge
lattice         sc 3.0
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
group           odd id 1:64:2
set             group odd type 2
mass            1 15.0
mass            2 20.0
set             type 1 charge 0.5
set             type 2 charge -0.5
variable        dx atom 0.15*sin(0.43*x+0.27*y)
variable        dy atom 0.15*cos(0.31*y-0.23*z)
variable        dz atom 0.15*sin(0.37*z+0.19*x)
displace_atoms  all move v_dx v_dy v_dz units box
velocity        all create 50.0 4928 loop geom
pair_style      lj/cut/coul/long 5.5
pair_coeff      * * 0.15 2.9
pair_modify     table 0
kspace_style    ewald 1.0e-6
fix             1 all nve
fix             2 all deform 1 x scale 1.4 remap x
thermo_style    custom step temp pe evdwl ecoul elong etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz lx
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             60
